<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>测测国庆你最适合去的城市</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg1:#fff7ee;
    --bg2:#ffe9d6;
    --ink:#3d2b1f;
    --ink2:#8a6f5c;
    --card:#ffffff;
    --line:#f0e2d2;
    --red:#e8543f;
    --red2:#f07a4b;
    --gold:#f2b134;
    --teal:#3fa796;
    --blue:#5b8def;
    --purple:#9b7ede;
    --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(210,120,60,.14);
    --radius:18px;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  html{font-size:16px}
  body{
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei","Noto Sans SC",sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 85% -10%, rgba(242,177,52,.18), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(800px 500px at -10% 30%, rgba(232,84,63,.10), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
    min-height:100vh;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 48px;position:relative}

  /* ===== 通用 ===== */
  .screen{display:none;animation:fadeUp .45s ease both}
  .screen.active{display:block}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;
    border-radius:999px;transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, opacity .15s;
  }
  .btn:active{transform:scale(.96)}
  .btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--red),var(--red2));
    color:#fff;font-size:1.05rem;padding:14px 34px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(232,84,63,.35);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(232,84,63,.45);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .btn-ghost{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);color:var(--ink2);
    border:1.5px solid var(--line);font-size:.95rem;padding:12px 26px;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--red);border-color:#f3c9b8}
  .badge{
    display:inline-block;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#a3541e;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe9c7,#ffd9a8);
    padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:1px;
  }

  /* ===== 首页 ===== */
  .home-card{
    background:var(--card);border-radius:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #fff;
  }
  .hero{position:relative;padding:34px 24px 10px;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:1px;margin:6px 0 4px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#d43a2a,#f07a4b 55%,#e8a23a);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  }
  .hero p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.95rem}
  .hero svg{width:100%;max-width:440px;height:auto;display:block;margin:6px auto 0}
  .float{animation:float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;transform-origin:center}
  @keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-7px)}}
  .cloud{animation:drift 14s linear infinite}
  @keyframes drift{from{transform:translateX(-30px)}to{transform:translateX(60px)}}
  .home-body{padding:8px 24px 30px;text-align:center}
  .city-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin:18px 0 22px}
  .chip{
    font-size:.8rem;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;font-weight:600;
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  }
  .meta-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:22px;margin-bottom:22px}
  .meta-item{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink2)}
  .meta-item b{display:block;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--ink)}
  .note{font-size:.75rem;color:#b09a86;margin-top:16px}

  /* ===== 答题页 ===== */
  .quiz-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px}
  .q-count{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink2);font-weight:600}
  .q-count b{color:var(--red);font-size:1.05rem}
  .quit{font-size:.8rem;color:#b09a86;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
  .progress-track{
    height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f3e3d0;overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:inset 0 1px 3px rgba(180,120,60,.15);
  }
  .progress-fill{
    height:100%;width:0;border-radius:999px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--red2),var(--red));
    transition:width .45s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
    position:relative;
  }
  .progress-fill::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,rgba(255,255,255,.28) 0 8px,transparent 8px 16px);
  }
  .q-card{
    background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:26px 20px;margin-top:18px;border:1px solid #fff;
    animation:slideIn .38s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both;
  }
  @keyframes slideIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(26px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .q-card.back{animation:slideBack .38s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both}
  @keyframes slideBack{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-26px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .q-tag{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--red2);letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .q-title{font-size:1.18rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:20px}
  .opts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
  .opt{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-align:left;
    padding:14px 16px;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;
    font-size:.98rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5;
    background:#fdf8f2;border:2px solid var(--line);
    transition:all .18s ease;width:100%;
  }
  .opt:hover{border-color:#f0b892;background:#fff4e8;transform:translateX(3px)}
  .opt .radio{
    flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;
    border:2px solid #dcc3a8;position:relative;transition:all .18s;
  }
  .opt.selected{
    border-color:var(--red);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff1e8,#ffe3d1);
    box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(232,84,63,.16);font-weight:700;
  }
  .opt.selected .radio{border-color:var(--red);background:var(--red)}
  .opt.selected .radio::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;
  }
  .quiz-nav{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}
  .quiz-nav .btn{flex:1;padding:14px 0;font-size:1rem}
  .shake{animation:shake .4s ease}
  @keyframes shake{
    0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}
    20%{transform:translateX(-8px)}40%{transform:translateX(8px)}
    60%{transform:translateX(-5px)}80%{transform:translateX(5px)}
  }
  .toast{
    position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:12vh;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
    background:rgba(61,43,31,.92);color:#fff;font-size:.88rem;
    padding:11px 22px;border-radius:999px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;
    transition:all .3s ease;z-index:99;white-space:nowrap;max-width:90vw;
  }
  .toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}

  /* ===== 结果页 ===== */
  .result-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px}
  .result-head h2{font-size:1.45rem;margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:1px}
  .ticket{
    background:var(--card);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #fff;position:relative;
    animation:ticketIn .6s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both;
  }
  @keyframes ticketIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9) translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .ticket-top{
    padding:26px 22px 20px;color:#fff;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .ticket-top::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;right:-30px;top:-30px;width:130px;height:130px;
    border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  }
  .ticket-top::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;right:20px;bottom:-40px;width:80px;height:80px;
    border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
  }
  .ticket-top .t-label{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:4px;opacity:.85}
  .ticket-top .t-city{font-size:2.3rem;font-weight:900;margin:6px 0 2px;text-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
  .ticket-top .t-tag{font-size:.9rem;opacity:.92}
  .ticket-top .t-emoji{font-size:2.6rem;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;animation:float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite}
  .match-pill{
    display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);border-radius:999px;
    padding:6px 20px;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
  }
  .ticket-mid{padding:20px 22px 6px;position:relative}
  .ticket-mid::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;border-top:2px dashed var(--line);
  }
  .notch{position:absolute;top:-11px;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg2)}
  .notch.l{left:-11px}.notch.r{right:-11px}
  .t-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .t-tagchip{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#fdf1e4;color:#b06a3a;border:1px solid #f5ddc4}
  .t-desc{font-size:.93rem;color:#5c4a3a;text-align:justify}
  .sec{padding:18px 22px}
  .sec h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .sec h3::before{content:"";width:5px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(var(--red),var(--gold))}
  .dims{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
  .dim-row .dim-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:5px}
  .dim-row .dim-head b{color:var(--ink)}
  .dim-row .dim-head span{color:var(--ink2);font-weight:700}
  .dim-track{height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f6ecdf;overflow:hidden}
  .dim-fill{height:100%;border-radius:999px;width:0;transition:width .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
  .dim-note{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink2);margin-top:4px}
  .tips{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
  .tips li{
    background:#fdf8f2;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:11px 14px;font-size:.88rem;color:#5c4a3a;display:flex;gap:10px;line-height:1.55;
  }
  .tips li .no{
    flex:0 0 22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:2px;
  }
  .result-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin:26px 0 6px}
  .result-actions .btn{flex:1;padding:14px 0;font-size:1rem}
  .disclaimer{
    text-align:center;font-size:.72rem;color:#bbA78f;margin-top:22px;line-height:1.7;
  }
  .again-card{
    background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:16px 18px;margin-top:16px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.7;
  }
  .again-card b{color:var(--ink)}

  @media (max-width:420px){
    .hero h1{font-size:1.55rem}
    .ticket-top .t-city{font-size:1.9rem}
    .q-card{padding:22px 16px}
    .sec{padding:16px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <!-- ================= 首页 ================= -->
  <section id="screen-home" class="screen active">
    <div class="home-card">
      <div class="hero">
        <span class="badge">🇨🇳 国庆出行特辑 · 趣味测评</span>
        <h1>测测国庆<br>你最适合去的城市</h1>
        <p>12 道轻松小题，为你匹配一座最合拍的目的地</p>
        <!-- 原创插画：旅途小场景 -->
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 210" role="img" aria-label="旅途插画">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="sky" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#ffe9c9"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff6ea"></stop>
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="mt1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#f2a65e"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e88b52"></stop>
            </linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="mt2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#e8704f"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#d95440"></stop>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="440" height="210" rx="18" fill="url(#sky)"></rect>
          <g class="cloud" opacity=".8">
            <ellipse cx="90" cy="46" rx="30" ry="12" fill="#fff"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="112" cy="40" rx="20" ry="10" fill="#fff"></ellipse>
          </g>
          <g class="cloud" opacity=".65" style="animation-duration:18s">
            <ellipse cx="330" cy="66" rx="24" ry="9" fill="#fff"></ellipse>
            <ellipse cx="348" cy="61" rx="16" ry="8" fill="#fff"></ellipse>
          </g>
          <circle cx="368" cy="44" r="20" fill="#f2b134"></circle>
          <circle cx="368" cy="44" r="27" fill="#f2b134" opacity=".25"></circle>
          <path d="M0 168 L92 92 L150 148 L210 104 L286 170 Z" fill="url(#mt1)"></path>
          <path d="M150 210 L246 118 L330 190 L400 140 L440 210 Z" fill="url(#mt2)"></path>
          <path d="M246 118 L232 132 L246 128 L258 136 L272 128 L246 118" fill="#fff" opacity=".9"></path>
          <g class="float">
            <path d="M120 52 q10 -14 34 -8 l58 8 q16 2 14 12 t-16 8 l-40 -2 -30 18 q-8 4 -12 -2 t2 -12 l14 -10 -30 -4 q-8 -2 6 -8z" fill="#5b8def" transform="translate(60,-6) scale(.9)"></path>
            <path d="M214 46 l10 4 -10 4 -4 -4z" fill="#2f5fc4"></path>
          </g>
          <g>
            <rect x="196" y="128" width="8" height="40" rx="3" fill="#a3541e"></rect>
            <circle cx="200" cy="120" r="9" fill="#e8543f"></circle>
            <circle cx="200" cy="120" r="4" fill="#ffd9a8"></circle>
            <rect x="256" y="138" width="7" height="30" rx="3" fill="#8a6f5c"></rect>
            <circle cx="259.5" cy="131" r="8" fill="#3fa796"></circle>
            <path d="M244 186 h96" stroke="#d9b98f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
            <path d="M180 186 h40" stroke="#d9b98f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="home-body">
        <div class="city-chips">
          <span class="chip" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8543f,#f07a4b)">成都</span>
          <span class="chip" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c05a3a,#e8964f)">西安</span>
          <span class="chip" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2f9e8f,#5cc9b8)">三亚</span>
          <span class="chip" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5b8def,#8fb1f5)">大理</span>
          <span class="chip" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9b7ede,#bda6ef)">上海</span>
          <span class="chip" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4494f,#ef7a72)">北京</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <div class="meta-item"><b>12</b>道趣味题</div>
          <div class="meta-item"><b>6</b>座候选城市</div>
          <div class="meta-item"><b>~3</b>分钟完成</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-start">🧳 开始测评</button>
        <p class="note">本测评为原创趣味自评，仅供出行灵感参考，非专业旅游规划或心理测试。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= 答题页 ================= -->
  <section id="screen-quiz" class="screen">
    <div class="quiz-top">
      <div class="q-count">第 <b id="q-now">12</b> / <span id="q-total">12</span> 题</div>
      <button class="quit" id="btn-quit">✕ 退出</button>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progress" style="width: 100%;"></div></div>
    <div class="q-card" id="q-card" style="">
      <div class="q-tag" id="q-tag">QUESTION 12 · 纪念品</div>
      <div class="q-title" id="q-title">回程行李箱里，你最想装进什么？</div>
      <div class="opts" id="q-opts"><button type="button" class="opt selected"><span class="radio"></span><span>真空包装的特产小吃，吃货认证</span></button><button type="button" class="opt"><span class="radio"></span><span>手工文创和小众饰品</span></button><button type="button" class="opt"><span class="radio"></span><span>购物战利品，大牌+新潮好物</span></button><button type="button" class="opt"><span class="radio"></span><span>贝壳、冰箱贴之类的小玩意</span></button></div>
      <div class="quiz-nav">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="btn-prev" style="visibility: visible;">← 上一题</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-next">✅ 提交并查看结果</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= 结果页 ================= -->
  <section id="screen-result" class="screen">
    <div class="result-head">
      <span class="badge">🎉 你的国庆目的地揭晓</span>
      <h2 id="r-title">你最适合去 <span style="color:#e8543f">成都</span></h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 车票式结果卡 -->
    <div class="ticket">
      <div class="ticket-top" id="t-top" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(232, 84, 63), rgb(240, 122, 75));">
        <span class="t-label">GOLDEN WEEK · TRAVEL TICKET</span>
        <span class="t-emoji" id="t-emoji">🐼</span>
        <div class="t-city" id="t-city">成都</div>
        <div class="t-tag" id="t-tagline">美食与慢生活的快乐老家</div>
        <div class="match-pill" id="t-match">契合度 60%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ticket-mid">
        <span class="notch l"></span><span class="notch r"></span>
        <div class="t-tags" id="t-tags"><span class="t-tagchip"># 美食之都</span><span class="t-tagchip"># 松弛感拉满</span><span class="t-tagchip"># 茶馆麻将</span><span class="t-tagchip"># 人均友好</span></div>
        <p class="t-desc" id="t-desc">成都几乎是为国庆量身定做的城市：宽窄巷子的人民公园喝茶、奎星楼的串串冒菜、玉林路的深夜小酒馆，节奏慢到刚好治愈你。11 月前后天气微凉不晒，火锅正香。你不需要排满行程——睡醒吃、吃了逛、逛累喝茶，就是最正确的打开方式。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec">
        <h3>你的旅行画像</h3>
        <div class="dims" id="r-dims"><div class="dim-row"><div class="dim-head"><b>都市活力</b><span>36%</span></div><div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-fill" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(155, 126, 222), rgb(189, 166, 239)); width: 36%;" data-w="36"></div></div></div><div class="dim-row"><div class="dim-head"><b>美食烟火</b><span>23%</span></div><div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-fill" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(232, 84, 63), rgb(242, 177, 52)); width: 23%;" data-w="23"></div></div></div><div class="dim-row"><div class="dim-head"><b>慢节奏治愈</b><span>18%</span></div><div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-fill" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(91, 141, 239), rgb(143, 177, 245)); width: 18%;" data-w="18"></div></div></div><div class="dim-row"><div class="dim-head"><b>自然风光</b><span>14%</span></div><div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-fill" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(63, 167, 150), rgb(92, 201, 184)); width: 14%;" data-w="14"></div></div></div><div class="dim-row"><div class="dim-head"><b>历史人文</b><span>9%</span></div><div class="dim-track"><div class="dim-fill" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(192, 90, 58), rgb(232, 150, 79)); width: 9%;" data-w="9"></div></div></div></div>
        <p class="dim-note" id="r-dim-note">你的旅行基因以 <b>都市活力</b> 和 <b>美食烟火</b> 为主——这正是 成都 最擅长提供的东西，所以它和你的气质一拍即合。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" style="padding-top:4px">
        <h3>行动建议</h3>
